Title: Chapter 5: The Room That Remembers
Creation-Date: 2026-07-10
Last-Modified: 2026-10-04
Output-Formats: 
Tagline: Multi-level structural encoding, chiastic structure, cantillation, each encoding the same content in a different structural feature, each independently verifiable. Plus the round trip, which catches loss where a consistency check only catches damage: a format that hands the artifact back unchanged has proved the parse took nothing the author never thought to declare important.
